{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/570192-cogs-in-the-wheel-your-angels","id":570192,"title":"Cogs in the Wheel - Your Angels","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-27T06:28:51-07:00","id":570192,"title":"Cogs in the Wheel - Your Angels","content":"Okay, I did search, and haven't found a topic like this. What types of Angels have you used in your Demon and GMC games? What types of tactics did they use? How were your PCs able to handle them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T07:48:13-07:00","id":570250,"title":"","content":"The Man is an Exile whose Influences covered Time and Death - originally, it was designed to assassinate people at <i>exactly</i> the right time, but then it broke.<br /> <br /> It was a GMC game that died before the players could really get into The Man's business; it raised a zombie and made a few unprovoked, erratic attacks against the PCs. The one fight they got into with it nearly resulted in a TPK, mainly due to a <i>really</i> dumb decision on the players' part (they let it chase them into an enclosed space.) The standard &quot;modus operandi&quot; was attacking to cripple, rather than kill.<br /> <br /> Its Numina were <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/278509-spooky-ghosts-and-nice-spirits-what-are-your-custom-numina\">Awful Presence</a> (keyed to the Insane Tilt), to represent an area of distorted time, Blast (which manifested as a &quot;muzzle flash&quot; from his hands and spontaneous bullet holes appearing in their target), and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/267418-stutter-step-numina?p=269690#post269690\">Stutter Step</a>.It was Rank 2, had a Ban against leaving witnesses, and a Bane of surgical tools.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-29T13:21:28-07:00","id":573073,"title":"","content":"Here are some low-level angels that my player encountered in my short lived Demon game. (It's on indefinite hiatus<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ), They werent a super hard challenge but were meant more as an intor to Angels.<br /> <br /> <b>Guiding Light</b><br /> <br /> Virtue: Patient - Guiding Lights will wait forever for their call to action to come.<br /> Vice: Aggressive - Once engaged the Guiding Lights will attack very aggressively, often without regard for strategy or tactics.<br /> Rank: 1<br /> Attributes: Power- 3 Finesse - 2 Resistance - 3 <br /> Influence: Machines<br /> Corpus: 8<br /> Willpower: 5<br /> Size: 5<br /> Speed: 10 (species factor 5)<br /> Defense: 3<br /> Initiative: 5<br /> Armor:<br /> Ban: Guiding Lights must construct any kits (model, furniture, kit car, etc) that are placed in front of them.<br /> Bane: Anti-freeze<br /> Numina: <br /> <br /> Fork<br /> Left-Handed Spanner<br /> <br /> <b>Tekton</b><br /> <br /> The Angel Tekton was summoned to assemble a cult that could be used to enforce the will of the God-Machine in the Seattle area in the Modern Age (Circa 1976). He has since built up his power and influence in the area to control all of the masons lodges (either overtly or discreetly) as well as a number of other smaller God-Machine projects in the area.<br /> <br /> Current Status<br /> <br /> Current Essence: 9<br /> Current Willpower: 7<br /> <br /> Stats:<br /> <br /> Rank: 2<br /> Attributes: Power 3 Finesse 5 Resistance 4<br /> Virtue: Patience<br /> Vice: Ambitious<br /> Corpus: 9<br /> Maximum Essence: 15<br /> Willpower: 9<br /> Initiative: 9<br /> Defense: 3<br /> Speed: 13<br /> Size: 5<br /> Ban: If presented with a filled out form, the Angel must read it and then stamp it either denied or approved.<br /> Bane: Rust from the bottom of the sea.<br /> <br /> Influences: Bureaucracy (3), Masons (2)<br /> Manifestations:<br /> Twilight Form<br /> Fetter<br /> Possess<br /> Materialize<br /> <br /> Numina: <br /> Implant Mission<br /> Regenerate<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}